{"id":"u-b55d1c08-8813-402f-acdb-debccde7cbf9","src":"community","title":"GIGANTOMACHY","author":"SpicyEtherious","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/ZOp55c-gigantomachy","desc":"GIGANTOMACHY is a 15-week hybrid strength and athletic development program inspired by the ancient war of the earth-born Giants against the Olympian gods. It is built to develop the complete lifter: heavy strength, real muscle mass, explosive power, and high work capacity.\nThis is not a watered-down beginner plan or a pure power building template. The weekly structure stays the same from day one to week fifteen. Only the exercise variations, loading, and intensity scale to the individual. A newer lifter and an advanced lifter can run the exact same program.\nWeekly Structure\n\nMonday — Lower Strength\nTuesday — Upper Strength\nWednesday — Hypertrophy 1\nThursday — Functionality\nFriday — Hypertrophy 2\nSaturday & Sunday — Complete rest\n\nProgram Phases\n\nWeeks 1–4: Alcyoneus Foundation — Learn the movements and build sustainable volume\nWeeks 5–8: Enceladus Build — Prioritize muscle and size accumulation\nWeeks 9–12: Porphyrion Strength — Emphasize heavy strength and high-quality performance\nWeeks 13–15: Ephialtes Performance — Express strength, size, power, and conditioning together","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle","Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-01T17:02:12.875Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Lower strength","Upper strength","Hypertrophy 1","functionality","Hypertrophy 2"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":6,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Press (45 Degrees)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lunge (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets"